    "detailed_description": "<strong>VoxVR Viewer</strong> enables you to view your voxel models from a whole new perspective! You can import all common voxel file formats like .vox, .qb, and more from other voxel software like Magica Voxel, Qubicle or Voxelshop to explore them from within VR.<br><br>VoxVR Viewer is a restricted version of VoxVR which can not be used to edit or create models. <br>If you like this software, check out <strong>VoxVR - The Virtual Reality Voxel Art Editor</strong> on Steam.<br>VoxVR allows you to not only view voxel models, but build them in VR!<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/504990/extras/a46ed2d3a688050b423a2b411a783d33.avif?t=1511268171\" /></div><br><br>Please keep in mind, that VoxVR Viewer is still in active development - anything is is subject to change.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/504990/extras/cb5fdab05bbb75e680d8dec4112d0215.webp?t=1511268171\" /></div><br><br>Currently supported import formats:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> .vox (Magica Voxel)<br></li><li> .qb (Qubicle)<br></li><li> .png (Image)<br></li><li> .vxvr (VoxVR)</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/504990/extras/070361de94994ce7453c8cfb1331594a.avif?t=1511268171\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>VoxVR Viewer</strong> enables you to view your voxel models from a whole new perspective! You can import all common voxel file formats like .vox, .qb, and more from other voxel software like Magica Voxel, Qubicle or Voxelshop to explore them from within VR.<br><br>VoxVR Viewer is a restricted version of VoxVR which can not be used to edit or create models. <br>If you like this software, check out <strong>VoxVR - The Virtual Reality Voxel Art Editor</strong> on Steam.<br>VoxVR allows you to not only view voxel models, but build them in VR!<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/504990/extras/a46ed2d3a688050b423a2b411a783d33.avif?t=1511268171\" /></div><br><br>Please keep in mind, that VoxVR Viewer is still in active development - anything is is subject to change.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/504990/extras/cb5fdab05bbb75e680d8dec4112d0215.webp?t=1511268171\" /></div><br><br>Currently supported import formats:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> .vox (Magica Voxel)<br></li><li> .qb (Qubicle)<br></li><li> .png (Image)<br></li><li> .vxvr (VoxVR)</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/504990/extras/070361de94994ce7453c8cfb1331594a.avif?t=1511268171\" /></div>",
